; Save on ISO-25: N asks for the name again, Y redefines ISO-25 with DIMTXT 3.5 and the
; override is gone; U brings back ISO-25 and the override ([0.8-RT28], work #717).
; Expected values: -DIMSTYLE prompts from the PT28 card (point 2); messages from the
; AutoCAD LT 2026 history autocad-dimstyle.txt (Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit
; 5170f1860953b5d076aa435bd65daa725d431745), translated as DECISIONI.md, 2026-11-02,
; "Testi inglesi dei messaggi", and the owner's decision in #716.
DIMTXT
3.5
-DIMSTYLE
S
ISO-25
N
ISO-25
Y
-DIMSTYLE
!esc
DIMTXT
0
U
-DIMSTYLE
!esc
